WEBVTT

00:14:58.127 --> 00:15:00.763
to lay claim to their democracy,

00:15:00.797 --> 00:15:04.734
its purpose as well as its processes,

00:15:04.734 --> 00:15:07.737
and ultimately to affirm
the American conscience.

00:15:07.737 --> 00:15:10.273
They are shouting kindness.

00:15:11.707 --> 00:15:15.278
If American-style democracy
is to have a chance,

00:15:15.278 --> 00:15:19.315
more of us had better
put our own cynicism down,

00:15:19.315 --> 00:15:21.818
summon up our own patriotism

00:15:22.919 --> 00:15:24.554
and join them.

00:15:24.587 --> 00:15:25.855
Thank you very much.

00:15:25.888 --> 00:15:27.757
(Applause)